From: fpvOS developers
Subject: [PATCH] media: wave5: add opt-in AR9311 encoder support

Adapt encoder stride, DMA buffer ownership, rate changes and recovery from
Missing-Lynk/ml-kernel e3885c6394a7025eacd3a23f473276d9823beb25.
Keep the existing decoder path and platform power resources.

